                                            of Preferred Stock shall have an initial conversion price of $0.571 per share of Company
                                            Common Stock; without giving effect to the 8:1 Reverse Split. Giving effect to the 8:1 Reverse
                                            Split, shares of Preferred Stock shall have an initial conversion price of $4.566 per share
